00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:29.420
MINH DIEP: Thanks, Sven.

00:22:29.420 --> 00:22:33.920
So the Lustre solution,
the easiest place to find

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:36.780
is on the marketplace.

00:22:36.780 --> 00:22:43.300
So we just need to
search for Lustre.

00:22:46.220 --> 00:22:51.140
And here is our
offering, Lustre on GCP.

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:54.900
And as you see, it's similar
to any other offering.

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:57.020
So when we launch--

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:01.880
keep in mind that this solution
is along multiple instances.

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:06.500
So you may want to
plan ahead of time.

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:12.860
But we do provide step by step
and predefined profile for you

00:23:12.860 --> 00:23:15.470
to just launch the easiest.

00:23:15.470 --> 00:23:17.340
So all you need is
a couple of steps.

00:23:17.340 --> 00:23:21.290
So the deployment name
is already pre-filled.

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:24.270
If you have one
deployed already,

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:28.280
it will change this deployment
name to a different one.

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:30.980
The zone, you can
select your zone.

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:33.890
And the network, by default,
it just picks whatever network

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:36.050
that your zone's in.

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:39.050
One thing that you
might want to consider

00:23:39.050 --> 00:23:43.610
is using the private Lustre
network that you're choosing.

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:51.160
So for this demo, I
am going just arrange.

00:23:51.160 --> 00:23:55.360
And if you want
to access directly

00:23:55.360 --> 00:24:00.160
to your cluster from outside,
you can just pick external IP,

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:02.200
automatically allocate for you.

00:24:02.200 --> 00:24:05.020
Or you can just select None.

00:24:05.020 --> 00:24:07.150
And it will create a
rounder so that you

00:24:07.150 --> 00:24:09.490
can have a gateway to
jump into before you

00:24:09.490 --> 00:24:12.400
go into your cluster.

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:15.340
File system name,
you can change it.

00:24:15.340 --> 00:24:20.770
Here is something that we have
predefined a couple of profiles

00:24:20.770 --> 00:24:26.210
to help a new user or user
have different level of need.

00:24:26.210 --> 00:24:29.490
So quick start is pretty
small, standard, standard plus

00:24:29.490 --> 00:24:31.270
and premium.

00:24:31.270 --> 00:24:35.830
For today's demo, I am going
to just select the premium.

00:24:35.830 --> 00:24:39.850
And it also can be
a capacity based,

00:24:39.850 --> 00:24:47.330
where each profile has a minimum
requirement for capacity.

00:24:47.330 --> 00:24:51.100
So if you want to increase more
than that, you just enter here.

00:24:51.100 --> 00:24:57.340
And step four, if you
don't select any profile

00:24:57.340 --> 00:25:00.550
on step three, you
can go into step four

00:25:00.550 --> 00:25:07.150
and make change to your
